yle=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n          粉波旁\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n          品种的二氧化碳浸渍的厌氧日晒处理，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n          入口有番石榴的气息，然后转为洛神花和蔓越莓般的酸质\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n          复合\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n          似紫色葡萄的果香，果酸轻柔绵长。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n          Pink bourbon, 粉红波旁，也是近十几年才开始在哥伦的Huila产区被发现，它是红波旁和黄波旁自然混种出来的一个稀有品种，果子成熟后呈现微粉的红色，介于红色和橘黄色之间，所以得名粉红波旁。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sa